      "text": "---"
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "scene 025.6 — recovery / new community / nephoretti watching"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "scene meta:"
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "location: Compound Infirmary / Rebuilt Compound"
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "time: year 17,503 (Days/weeks after scene 025.5)"
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "participants: The Nameless One, Mika, The Five, Recovering Reptilian, Freed Slaves, Nephoretti (distant observers)"
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "focus: Geralt awakens from near-fatal injuries to find the Anunnaki dead, the compound transformed into a self-governing community, the Reptilian honored as a living legend and choosing to stay, and the Nephoretti watching from adjacent realms."
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "continuity: Days/weeks after scene 025.5; final scene of Chapter 025"
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "presentation: cutscene"
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "cutscene purpose: Conclude Chapter 025 with the aftermath of victory, community rebuilding, and the subtle setup for the Nephoretti.",
      "inferred": {
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Nephoretti",
            "label": "triumph",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "EPILOGUE: RECOVERY"
    },
    {
      "line": 30,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 31,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Time passed in fragments."
    },
    {
      "line": 32,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Days, perhaps."
    },
    {
      "line": 33,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Weeks."
    },
    {
      "line": 34,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Nameless One drifted through consciousness that felt less like sleep and more like existing between states, hovering in space where life and death negotiated boundaries."
    },
    {
      "line": 35,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 36,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Applicator remained dormant, conserving resources, maintaining minimal intervention that kept catastrophic damage from becoming fatal."
    },
    {
      "line": 37,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Bones knitted slowly."
    },
    {
      "line": 38,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Organs that had been ruptured began healing."
    },
    {
      "line": 39,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Spine that had shattered found ways to reconnect through processes that defied normal human physiology—enhanced by genetic engineering, supported by parasitic consciousness that needed host to survive."
    },
    {
      "line": 40,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 41,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "When awareness finally returned—fragmented, uncertain, but present—he woke to transformed world."
    },
    {
      "line": 42,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 43,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The compound belonged to them."
    },
    {
      "line": 44,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Truly belonged."
    },
    {
      "line": 45,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 46,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The gates stood open."
    },
    {
      "line": 47,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The perimeter walls showed gaps where freed slaves had begun dismantling the barriers that had defined their captivity."
    },
    {
      "line": 48,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Anunnaki's body had been... handled somehow."
    },
    {
      "line": 49,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Removed."
    },
    {
      "line": 50,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The evidence of divine mortality processed by beings still learning to exist without masters."
    },
    {
      "line": 51,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 52,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scarred one sat beside him, older-looking than he remembered."
    },
    {
      "line": 53,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She'd spent however-long-he'd-been-unconscious running the compound, organizing, transforming desperate survivors into community that functioned without oppression."
    },
    {
      "line": 54,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 55,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her hands formed gestures when she saw his eyes open:"
    },
    {
      "line": 56,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 57,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Welcome-back, relief-evident"
    },
    {
      "line": 58,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(You return."
    },
    {
      "line": 59,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We feared you wouldn't.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 60,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 61,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "How long? he managed, his own hands weak but functional."
    },
    {
      "line": 62,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 63,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Many days."
    },
    {
      "line": 64,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "You were... broken."
    },
    {
      "line": 65,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Healing seemed impossible."
    },
    {
      "line": 66,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But here you are."
    },
    {
      "line": 67,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 68,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He looked around the space they'd converted into something approaching infirmary."
    },
    {
      "line": 69,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Other wounded slaves recovered nearby—casualties from the battle who'd survived despite brutal injuries."
    },
    {
      "line": 70,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The five took turns watching over everyone, no longer synchronized but still coordinated, still working together with bond that transcended simple friendship."
    },
    {
      "line": 71,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 72,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And there, in the far corner on a reinforced pallet designed for his massive frame—"
    },
    {
      "line": 73,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 74,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Reptilian? he gestured with urgent concern."
    },
    {
      "line": 75,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 76,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The scarred one's expression softened with relief:",
      "inferred": {
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Reptilian",
            "label": "relief",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 77,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 78,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Alive."
    },
    {
      "line": 79,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Healing slower than you, but alive."
    },
    {
      "line": 80,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His body entered some kind of... protective state."
    },
    {
      "line": 81,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reptilian biology different from ours."
    },
    {
      "line": 82,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He wakes sometimes, eats, then returns to healing-sleep."
    },
    {
      "line": 83,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 84,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He saved me."
    },
    {
      "line": 85,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 86,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He saved all of us, she corrected."
    },
    {
      "line": 87,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Without him, the Anunnaki would have killed you, then slaughtered the rest."
    },
    {
      "line": 88,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He chose."
    },
    {
      "line": 89,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Finally chose."
    },
    {
      "line": 90,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 91,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Nameless One turned his head—painfully, slowly—and could just see the Reptilian's form."
    },
    {
      "line": 92,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Scales still showed cracks from the battle's damage, but color was returning."
    },
    {
      "line": 93,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The massive chest rose and fell with steady rhythm."
    },
    {
      "line": 94,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not death."
    },
    {
      "line": 95,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Deep healing that his biology facilitated in ways human physiology couldn't match."
    },
    {
      "line": 96,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 97,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Honored-symbol, gratitude-gesture"
    },
    {
      "line": 98,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(He's treated with honor?"
    },
    {
      "line": 99,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Given what he needs?)"
    },
    {
      "line": 100,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 101,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "More than honor, the scarred one's hands moved emphatically."
    },
    {
      "line": 102,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Reverence."
    },
    {
      "line": 103,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Freed slaves bring him the best food."
    },
    {
      "line": 104,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tend his wounds."
    },
    {
      "line": 105,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tell their children stories of the Overseer who became hero."
    },
    {
      "line": 106,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He's legend now."
    },
    {
      "line": 107,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Living legend."
    },
    {
      "line": 108,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 109,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Anunnaki?"
    },
    {
      "line": 110,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 111,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Burned."
    },
    {
      "line": 112,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ashes scattered."
    },
    {
      "line": 113,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No monuments for masters, even dead ones."
    },
    {
      "line": 114,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 115,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Federation?"
    },
    {
      "line": 116,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 117,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Haven't returned."
    },
    {
      "line": 118,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Thirty-day cycle passed."
    },
    {
      "line": 119,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They're overdue."
    },
    {
      "line": 120,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We don't know if that's good or threatening."
    },
    {
      "line": 121,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 122,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He processed this information slowly, brain still recovering from trauma that should have been fatal."
    },
    {
      "line": 123,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tried to sit up."
    },
    {
      "line": 124,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Failed."
    },
    {
      "line": 125,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Tried again with more success."
    },
    {
      "line": 126,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 127,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The compound had changed in ways beyond infrastructure."
    },
    {
      "line": 128,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Through the infirmary's opening, he could see freed slaves moving with purpose that wasn't driven by fear or routine.",
      "inferred": {
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Freed",
            "label": "fear",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 129,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They built—not weapons, but shelters."
    },
    {
      "line": 130,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not defenses, but homes."
    },
    {
      "line": 131,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Transforming prison into place they might choose to remain not because walls forced them, but because community gave them reason."
    },
    {
      "line": 132,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 133,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Children played in spaces that had known only suffering."
    },
    {
      "line": 134,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not many—genetic engineering hadn't included reproduction as priority—but enough that laughter existed where screams had echoed."
    },
    {
      "line": 135,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 136,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We've begun building, the scarred one's hands informed him."
    },
    {
      "line": 137,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Not just repairs."
    },
    {
      "line": 138,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Creation."
    },
    {
      "line": 139,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We're making this place ours rather than theirs."
    },
    {
      "line": 140,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 141,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But we could leave, he gestured back."
    },
    {
      "line": 142,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gates are open."
    },
    {
      "line": 143,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Nothing stops us."
    },
    {
      "line": 144,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 145,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Her expression showed understanding of truth he was still processing:"
    },
    {
      "line": 146,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 147,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Where would we go?"
    },
    {
      "line": 148,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We were created here."
    },
    {
      "line": 149,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "This is the only home we've known."
    },
    {
      "line": 150,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Why flee from freedom to seek it elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "line": 151,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 152,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "We remake this place."
    },
    {
      "line": 153,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Transform it."
    },
    {
      "line": 154,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Make it represent what we choose rather than what was imposed."
    },
    {
      "line": 155,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 156,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He understood."
    },
    {
      "line": 157,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Saw the wisdom in claiming the compound rather than abandoning it."
    },
    {
      "line": 158,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Making freedom mean transformation rather than flight."
    },
    {
      "line": 159,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 160,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Days continued."
    },
    {
      "line": 161,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His strength returned incrementally."
    },
    {
      "line": 162,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Applicator remained mostly dormant, offering healing support but maintaining promised distance."
    },
    {
      "line": 163,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The partnership they'd negotiated in the crystalline chamber held—consciousness shared but autonomy respected, presence tolerated because cooperation proved valuable."
    },
    {
      "line": 164,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 165,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "He began moving through the compound as recovery progressed."
    },
    {
      "line": 166,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Saw the changes up close."
    },
    {
      "line": 167,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The dormitories converted to individual spaces."
    },
    {
      "line": 168,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The mining equipment repurposed for construction."
    },
    {
      "line": 169,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The observation platform—rebuilt after he'd destroyed the original—now served as community gathering point rather than surveillance post."
    },
    {
      "line": 170,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 171,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "One day, as he practiced walking with the scarred one's support, he heard it—a deep, rumbling sound that made both of them freeze."
    },
    {
      "line": 172,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 173,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Reptilian was awake."
    },
    {
      "line": 174,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 175,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They returned to the infirmary to find him sitting upright for the first time since the battle."
    },
    {
      "line": 176,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His scales had regained most of their luster."
    },
    {
      "line": 177,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The cracks had healed into scars that would mark him permanently but didn't seem to impair function."
    },
    {
      "line": 178,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His eyes—those terrible, slitted eyes—held awareness that had been absent during his healing-sleep."
    },
    {
      "line": 179,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 180,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Nameless One approached slowly.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "approach",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 181,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Extended his hand in gesture-language they'd taught him:"
    },
    {
      "line": 182,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 183,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Gratitude-symbol, life-debt, eternal-thanks",
      "inferred": {
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Nameless",
            "label": "gratitude",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 184,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(You saved my life."
    },
    {
      "line": 185,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I owe you everything."
    },
    {
      "line": 186,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Thank you.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 187,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 188,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Reptilian's response was slow, deliberate, his massive hands forming gestures with surprising gentleness:",
      "inferred": {
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Reptilian",
            "label": "gentleness",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 189,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 190,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No-debt, choice-made, purpose-found"
    },
    {
      "line": 191,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(You owe nothing."
    },
    {
      "line": 192,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I made choice."
    },
    {
      "line": 193,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Found purpose I'd been missing.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 194,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 195,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Regret-symbol, question-mark"
    },
    {
      "line": 196,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(Do you regret it?"
    },
    {
      "line": 197,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The choice?"
    },
    {
      "line": 198,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The battle?)"
    },
    {
      "line": 199,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 200,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Reptilian's expression—still difficult to read on scaled features—showed something that might have been peace:"
    },
    {
      "line": 201,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 202,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "No-regret, clarity-found, worthy-price"
    },
    {
      "line": 203,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(No regret."
    },
    {
      "line": 204,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Found clarity."
    },
    {
      "line": 205,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Price was worth paying.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 206,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 207,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Future-question, what-now"
    },
    {
      "line": 208,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(What will you do now?"
    },
    {
      "line": 209,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Where will you go?)"
    },
    {
      "line": 210,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 211,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Reptilian gestured toward the open gates, then back toward the compound itself, then formed sequence that carried weight:"
    },
    {
      "line": 212,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 213,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Stay-here, belong-here, build-with-you"
    },
    {
      "line": 214,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "(I stay."
    },
    {
      "line": 215,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I belong here now."
    },
    {
      "line": 216,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "I build with you.)"
    },
    {
      "line": 217,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 218,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Relief flooded through The Nameless One.",
      "inferred": {
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Nameless",
            "label": "relief",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 219,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Having the Reptilian—having The Reptilian , because surely a being who'd done what he'd done deserved a name—as permanent ally rather than temporary savior meant resources they desperately needed."
    },
    {
      "line": 220,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His strength."
    },
    {
      "line": 221,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His knowledge of Anunnaki systems."
    },
    {
      "line": 222,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "His perspective as one who'd served both as master and slave."
    },
    {
      "line": 223,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 224,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "They were building something."
    },
    {
      "line": 225,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Creating society from scattered survivors."
    },
    {
      "line": 226,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Proving that beings designed as tools could become people given opportunity."
    },
    {
      "line": 227,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 228,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And through it all, at the edge of perception, he sometimes glimpsed them:"
    },
    {
      "line": 229,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 230,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The Nephoretti."
    },
    {
      "line": 231,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Watching from spaces adjacent to physical realm."
    },
    {
      "line": 232,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Patient.",
      "inferred": {
        "emotion": [
          {
            "subject": "Nephoretti",
            "label": "patience",
            "confidence": 1.0
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 233,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Waiting."
    },
    {
      "line": 234,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For what, he couldn't determine."
    },
    {
      "line": 235,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But their presence felt less threatening now and more... expectant."
    },
    {
      "line": 236,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "As though recovery wasn't endpoint but preparation for something else."
    },
    {
      "line": 237,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 238,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Something that waited in the deep places where crystal formations pulsed with cold light."
    },
    {
      "line": 239,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 240,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Something that would require him to venture into the compound's unexplored sections, to follow the sound of water trickling through ancient stone, to discover gifts that had been promised before consciousness was ready to receive them."
    },
    {
      "line": 241,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 242,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But that could wait."
    },
    {
      "line": 243,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "For now, he healed."
    },
    {
      "line": 244,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Learned to walk without pain."
    },
    {
      "line": 245,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Practiced gesture-language with increasing sophistication."
    },
    {
      "line": 246,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Helped the scarred one organize their nascent society."
    },
    {
      "line": 247,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And watched as the Reptilian—as The Reptilian —integrated into the community that had every reason to reject him but chose acceptance instead.",
      "inferred": {
        "action": [
          {
            "label": "observe",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 248,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 249,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Freedom had been won."
    },
    {
      "line": 250,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Blood had been spilled."
    },
    {
      "line": 251,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Sacrifices had been made."
    },
    {
      "line": 252,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 253,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But no one had died who didn't deserve death."
    },
    {
      "line": 254,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 255,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The heroes lived."
    },
    {
      "line": 256,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Scarred."
    },
    {
      "line": 257,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Changed."
    },
    {
      "line": 258,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "But alive and determined to build something worthy of the price they'd paid."
    },
    {
      "line": 259,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 260,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "The compound thrived under twin suns that blazed over beings learning to exist without chains."
    },
    {
      "line": 261,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 262,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "And somewhere in the darkness beneath, something ancient stirred and waited."
    },
    {
      "line": 263,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 264,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Patient."
    },
    {
      "line": 265,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 266,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Inevitable."
    },
    {
      "line": 267,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 268,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Ready to offer gifts that would transform everything once again."
    },
    {
      "line": 269,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 270,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "end of chapter 025-confined freedom"
    }
